9
00:01:16,439 --> 00:01:17,239
Miss.

10
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:19,959
Brother.

11
00:01:21,439 --> 00:01:21,959
Brother.

12
00:01:23,359 --> 00:01:23,840
Brother.

13
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,159
You're here.

14
00:01:27,519 --> 00:01:28,519
You're really here.

15
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,640
