24
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,439
I am Sui'er!

25
00:02:14,479 --> 00:02:15,680
I am Sui'er!

26
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,400
I will kill you

27
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,840
to avenge father!

28
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:24,439
Kill you! Avenge!

29
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:29,840
Avenge!

30
00:02:32,159 --> 00:02:32,800
Brother!

31
00:02:33,439 --> 00:02:35,759
Kill you! Avenge!

32
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,840
What are you talking about?

33
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:40,159
Why do you say I killed our father?

34
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:41,319
Brother.

35
00:02:41,919 --> 00:02:43,120
I'll kill you.

36
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:02,879
Brother.

37
00:03:03,479 --> 00:03:04,199
Brother.

38
00:03:04,719 --> 00:03:06,000
Are you okay?

39
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:18,840
What a touching play of brother and sister

40
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,479
turning against each other.

41
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:22,520
Shen Suhe.

42
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,800
You like acting the most.

43
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:26,639
Are you satisfied

44
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,759
with this play I've arranged?

45
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:31,800
Ling Chuchu,

46
00:03:33,919 --> 00:03:35,919
