47
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:40,120
I found something

48
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,400
in the secret chamber.

49
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:45,120
I heard him say

50
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:46,840
he used it to control Shen Yi,

51
00:03:47,159 --> 00:03:49,560
so I thought I'd try it on your brother.

52
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,479
I didn't expect that in just a few minutes,

53
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:55,759
your brother would be at my command.

54
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,639
Taro powder?

55
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,400
How can there be taro powder?

56
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,000
So it's taro powder.

57
00:04:03,919 --> 00:04:05,680
My brother has no grudges against you.

58
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,599
Why did you do this?

59
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:08,639
Shen Suhe,

60
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,719
thanks to you,

61
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,759
I lost everything.

62
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:14,759
If you don't let me live,

63
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,879
I won't let you live, either.

64
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,199
Ling Chuchu,

65
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:21,319
you've insulted me in every way before,

66
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,399
but as long as you don't hurt my family,

67
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,000
I can let bygones be bygones

68
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,240
and spare your life.

69
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,959
Now that you're so ruthless,

70
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,519
