71
00:04:34,519 --> 00:04:35,360
Brother, save me.

72
00:04:42,279 --> 00:04:42,920
Brother.

73
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:43,720
Brother.

74
00:04:44,199 --> 00:04:45,319
You have to avenge me.

75
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:46,319
