85
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,439
How about that?

86
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:11,519
You...

87
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:12,120
Don't come over.

88
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,160
Or I'll kill him.

89
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:18,839
If I eat this,

90
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:21,480
