91
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:24,759
Don't you do anything for your family?

92
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,199
What?

93
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,480
Are you afraid of death now?

94
00:05:41,399 --> 00:05:42,160
Death?

95
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:46,079
I've died many times.

96
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,000
so I'm not afraid of death.

97
00:05:57,959 --> 00:05:58,879
I've eaten it.

98
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,680
Now can you let my brother go?

99
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,720
Shen Suhe,

100
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,879
I'll make you suffer.

101
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:12,959
I'll make you watch the people you love

102
00:06:12,959 --> 00:06:16,399
