103
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,639
What do you mean?

104
00:06:18,519 --> 00:06:19,959
I got you into this.

105
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,360
No.

106
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,319
Brother.

107
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,160
Brother.

108
00:06:33,959 --> 00:06:34,600
Brother.

109
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,639
Brother.

110
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:38,680
Sui'er.

111
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,360
Brother.

112
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:41,040
I got you into this.

113
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,120
No.

114
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:43,839
No.

115
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,240
Shen Suhe,

116
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,480
you're a disaster.

117
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:52,600
[Your mother,]

118
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:55,399
[father, brother,]

119
00:06:55,399 --> 00:06:56,720
[the whole residence,]

120
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,879
[and the Second Prince,]

121
00:06:59,759 --> 00:07:02,160
[they all died because of you.]

122
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,279
[It's you.]

123
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:08,959
[You killed them.]

124
00:07:11,839 --> 00:07:14,199
[You must live on,]

125
00:07:15,439 --> 00:07:20,120
[in endless pain.]

126
00:07:27,839 --> 00:07:28,680
Brother,

127
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,879
why did you do this?

128
00:07:30,879 --> 00:07:31,680
Brother,

129
00:07:32,279 --> 00:07:33,800
it's my fault.

130
00:07:33,959 --> 00:07:35,399
Sui'er.

131
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:37,839
Sui'er,

132
00:07:38,759 --> 00:07:40,000
it's not your fault.

133
00:07:41,399 --> 00:07:43,959
I was the one who fell for her.

134
00:07:44,439 --> 00:07:45,160
It's not your fault.

135
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:49,480
I can't protect you anymore.

136
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,160
You must live well,

137
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:53,800
For me,

138
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,079
for father,

139
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,480
for mother,

140
00:07:58,399 --> 00:08:03,560
live a good life.

141
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,319
Brother.

142
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,079
Brother.

143
00:08:16,839 --> 00:08:18,759
Is it really because of me?

144
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:20,680
Watch out!

145
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,680
Your mother,

146
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:30,920
father,

147
00:08:32,519 --> 00:08:35,279
brother, the entire mansion,

148
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,279
[and His Highness]

149
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:40,360
[all died because of you.]

150
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,480
[It's you.]

151
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:47,000
[You killed them.]

152
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:51,080
[You must live on,]

153
00:08:52,399 --> 00:08:53,799
[in endless]

154
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:56,039
[agony.]

155
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,039
I killed them.

156
00:08:59,039 --> 00:08:59,600
Sui'er.

157
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:00,320
It's me.

158
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:00,919
Sui'er

159
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:02,200
Sui'er

160
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,279
It's my fault.

161
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,480
It's my fault.

162
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:09,840
I'm sorry

163
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:12,240
for your brother.

164
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:15,799
Your Highness

165
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:20,480
Can I be alone for a while?

166
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:22,399
Okay.

167
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,080
I'll wait for you outside.

168
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:52,879
How is she?

169
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:21,720
Sui'er,

170
00:10:23,519 --> 00:10:25,120
are you still mad at me?

171
00:10:26,559 --> 00:10:27,559
Don't worry, Your Highness.

172
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:30,960
If we're to blame,

173
00:10:31,879 --> 00:10:34,080
it's all because I provoked Ling Chuchu,

174
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,320
which led to this situation.

175
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:40,159
It has nothing to do with you.

176
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,120
Then why...

177
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:43,679
Your Highness,

178
00:10:44,919 --> 00:10:46,440
we just met by chance.

179
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,120
You don't have to

180
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:50,759
ask about my business.

181
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,039
Shen Suhe.

182
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,279
Do you think

183
00:11:02,279 --> 00:11:04,080
I'm useless?

184
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:05,559
I don't.

185
00:11:06,519 --> 00:11:07,639
Then why do you think

186
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,080
you can

187
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,559
come and go as you please?

188
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,039
Yes.

189
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,159
I got involved with you first.

190
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:21,639
All my people are dead.

191
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,759
If you don't want to die,

192
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,080
leave me

193
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:27,720
as far as possible.

194
00:11:33,279 --> 00:11:34,159
Shen Suhe,

195
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,320
you have provoked me.

196
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,360
I won't let you go.

197
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:43,600
Your Highness,

198
00:11:44,799 --> 00:11:46,200
I'm dying.

199
00:11:47,519 --> 00:11:49,000
I have my own things to do.

200
00:11:49,879 --> 00:11:51,120
I have no time to be entangled with you.

201
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,399
Please let me go.

202
00:11:54,639 --> 00:11:55,879
A dying person?

203
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,200
How many secrets do you have?

204
00:11:59,039 --> 00:12:00,360
Can you tell me?

205
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:02,080
Can we face it together?

206
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:03,080
Please.

207
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,039
Let me go.

208
00:12:16,919 --> 00:12:17,799
Shen Suhe.

209
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,240
I won't let you go.

210
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:23,360
I'll wait until you tell me the truth.

211
00:12:32,039 --> 00:12:33,200
You must have received

212
00:12:33,639 --> 00:12:35,080
the news that the Western Shu Mission

213
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,200
has come to seek peace.

214
00:12:36,679 --> 00:12:37,159
Yes.

215
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,559
This time,

216
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:40,919
they want to form a matrimonial alliance

217
00:12:40,919 --> 00:12:42,200
with us

218
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:44,399
to end the decades of war.

219
00:12:44,639 --> 00:12:45,559
I'd like to hear

220
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,960
your thoughts on this marriage.

221
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,240
I believe

222
00:12:50,679 --> 00:12:52,000
that through this marriage,

223
00:12:52,639 --> 00:12:54,440
we can end the conflict with Western Shu

224
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:56,879
and bring peace to the border regions.

225
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,039
It would be

226
00:12:58,679 --> 00:13:00,000
a great benefit to the nation and its people.

227
00:13:00,679 --> 00:13:01,759
I agree.

228
00:13:04,799 --> 00:13:06,559
I have previously informed you

229
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,120
that the Princess of Western Shu has specifically requested

230
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:09,360
for you to be her consort.

231
00:13:09,799 --> 00:13:12,240
She will be visiting with the diplomatic mission.

232
00:13:13,159 --> 00:13:15,639
You will be in charge of

233
00:13:15,919 --> 00:13:17,279
receiving the mission.

234
00:13:18,039 --> 00:13:18,559
Your Majesty,

235
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:21,240
I'm just a soldier.

236
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:22,720
I'm afraid I'll neglect the mission.

237
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:23,519
You'd better...

238
00:13:23,519 --> 00:13:23,960
I

239
00:13:24,679 --> 00:13:26,559
entrust you with this task

240
00:13:26,559 --> 00:13:27,639
because I trust you.

241
00:13:27,639 --> 00:13:28,360
Besides,

242
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,600
you're not young anymore.

243
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,879
It's time to consider your marriage.

244
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,440
[My elder brother died.]

245
00:13:40,559 --> 00:13:41,639
[My father died.]

246
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,080
[I've tried so hard,]

247
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,879
[but I can't change their fate.]

248
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,200
[In my dream,]

249
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:51,480
[although Prince Yu appeared by my side]

250
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:52,600
[after I was expelled to Lingguo Temple,]

251
00:13:53,759 --> 00:13:55,440
[he had nothing to do with me.]

252
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,480
[But this time,]

253
00:13:57,960 --> 00:14:00,000
[he has been by my side from the beginning.]

254
00:14:00,639 --> 00:14:01,720
[It was his appearance]

255
00:14:02,279 --> 00:14:03,960
[that made me have an illusion about fate.]

256
00:14:05,039 --> 00:14:06,879
[But it seems that the ending can't be changed.]

257
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,399
[The Queen Mother will die.]

258
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:09,440
[I will also die.]

259
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:12,720
[Who is the person who killed the Queen Mother and me?]

260
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,720
[If I can find him,]

261
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:22,759
[can I end this wrong dream?]

262
00:14:26,799 --> 00:14:27,600
My Lady.

263
00:14:29,679 --> 00:14:30,679
My Lady, something's wrong.

264
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:31,519
What's wrong?

265
00:14:32,399 --> 00:14:33,399
Something happened to Consort Dowager Li.

266
00:14:33,919 --> 00:14:34,559
Consort Dowager?

267
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:37,519
It's about Prince Wu'an.

268
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,120
I heard that the Princess of Western Shu

269
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,279
has fallen in love with him.

270
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:42,159
This time, the envoy to Dakuai

271
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,879
is ostensibly for peace talks,

272
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:45,080
but actually,

273
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:46,679
it's to lure our Prince Wu'an over

274
00:14:46,879 --> 00:14:48,159
to be their Imperial Son-in-Law.

275
00:14:52,399 --> 00:14:53,240
Miss,

276
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,960
do you think His Highness will really marry

277
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:58,720
the Princess of Western Shu?

278
00:15:00,759 --> 00:15:02,000
It's none of my business.

279
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:06,080
Miss,

280
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:08,440
I can tell that you have feelings

281
00:15:09,879 --> 00:15:12,039
for Prince Yu,

282
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:13,240
right?

283
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,799
If he really marries the princess,

284
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,440
wouldn't you be sad?

285
00:15:23,639 --> 00:15:24,759
Would you marry her?
